digraph account_payable_process_96 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the senior accountant in your department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_XAOY" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_XAOY"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_XAOY" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_XAOY" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_XAOY" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_XAOY" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_XAOY"
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_XAOY"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_XAOY"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_TWJC" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_XAOY" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_TWJC"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_TWJC" -> "schedule the payment"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_TWJC" -> "stamp all documents"
		"store in paid invoice file" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_TWJC" -> "store in paid invoice file"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" [shape=box]
		"stamp all documents" -> "enter the invoice into the accounts payable account"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_TWJC" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"schedule the payment" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_TWJC"
		"enter the invoice into the accounts payable account" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_TWJC"
		"store in paid invoice file" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_TWJC"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the senior accountant in your department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_TWJC" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It starts with sending to the senior accountant in your department. 
Once sending to the senior accountant in your department occurs, you need to create a receiving report.
After creating a receiving report, one or more of the following paths should be executed: doubling check a three-way match, reporting errors to relevant team member, confirming all documents have been amended. 
Afterwards, the process is split into 3 parallel branches: scheduling the payment, stamping all documents and storing in paid invoice file. 
After stamping all documents, you need to enter the invoice into the accounts payable account.
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the payable process and starts with the account submitted by the senior accountant in your department.
Once the sending occurs to the senior accountant in your department, you need to create a receipt report.
After generating a receiving report, one or more of the following paths should be executed : double checking a three-way match, reporting errors to relevant team member, and confirming that all documents have been amended.
Then the process is divided into 3 parallel branches : ordering the payment, stamping all documents and storing in the paid invoice file.
After stamping all documents, you need to enter the invoice into the payable account.
The process is now completed.
"
}
